      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Columbia Theatre, Harlem’s first movie theater opened in 1949, is now being redeveloped as part of downtown revitalization.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
